sequenceDiagram
  title Boxes
  box rgba(200, 220, 255, 0.5) Frontend
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web
  end
  box LightGreen
    participant S as Service
  end
  participant Q
  U->>W: a rather long request text that widens the gap
  activate W
  W->>S: call
  Note over S,Q: both
  loop retry
    S-->>Q: ping
  end
  deactivate W
